# unspa local caches and artifacts
.unspa.json
# Per-project snapshot layout. Default-deny everything under unspa/ so the
# OSS repo doesn't accumulate user-generated projects, features, history
# files, implementation-status files, or orphan buckets. Real projects live
# in the developer's own clone; ready-made example projects ship via
# samples/ and load through the dashboard's "Load Sample Project" button.
unspa/*
# Only exception: the npm CLI test fixture used by NpmCliFeature.test.ts
# must ship so the test passes on a fresh clone. Its sibling README explains
# why the file is there so contributors don't mistake it for sample content.
!unspa/__unassigned/
unspa/__unassigned/*
!unspa/__unassigned/npm-cli-package-management.feature.json
!unspa/__unassigned/README.md
*.7z

